          "message": "[cmd/mdatagen][pdata/xpdata] Add xhash.WithUint64 to avoid gosec G115 in generated code (#16198)\n\n#### Description\n\nThe dataPointKey helper generated by mdatagen converted\n`pcommon.Timestamp` (`uint64`) to `int64` to hash it with\n`xhash.WithValue`, which `gosec` reports as G115 in every downstream\ncomponent using the generated code.\n\nAdd `xhash.WithUint64`, which hashes a `uint64` directly using the same\nencoding as an int value, and use it in the metrics template. Generated\nhash values are unchanged, and no `pcommon.Value` is allocated. The five\nsample components were regenerated.\n\nSmall refactor: the int case in `writeValueHash` now uses the same\n`writeUint64` helper, so the two encodings can't drift apart.\n\nThis fix does NOT change the repo-wide G115 exclusion (#15846). It\nremoves one source of the finding.\n\nAssisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5\n\n#### Link to tracking issue\n\nFixes #16176\n\n#### Testing\n\n**New test**: `TestWithUint64` covers `0`, `1`, `MaxInt64`, `MaxInt64+1`\nand `MaxUint64`. It checks that:\n* the same input always gives the same hash;\n* the hash equals the old `WithValue(NewValueInt(int64(v)))` result;\n* changing the value changes the hash;\n* order matters.\n\n**Unit tests**: `go test -race` passes for the `pdata/xpdata` and\n`cmd/mdatagen` modules.\n\n**Checks that passed**:\n* `make lint` and `make fmt` (both modules)\n* `make chlog-validate`, `checkapi`, `goimpi`, `goporto`,\n`checklicense`, `misspell`\n* `markdownlint`\n\n**Manual gosec check**: `gosec@master` (latest commit as of 17/10), run\non a small module using the generated pattern, found 2 G115 issues\nbefore the change and 0 after.\n\n#### Documentation\n\n* I added a doc comment to `WithUint64`.\n* `.chloggen/xhash-with-uint64.yaml`: enhancement, pkg/xpdata, API\nchangelog.\n* `.chloggen/mdatagen-datapointkey-gosec-g115.yaml`: bug_fix,\ncmd/mdatagen, user changelog.\n\n#### Authorship\n\n- [x] I, a human, wrote this pull request description myself.",
          "timestamp": "2026-10-22T11:29:09Z",
