          "distinct": false,
          "id": "8262bda65001c78ff6f4f8441d7a333b915ad3cb",
          "message": "Update module github.com/itchyny/gojq to v0.12.20 (#16294)\n\nThis PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Change |\n[Age](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n[Confidence](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [github.com/itchyny/gojq](https://redirect.github.com/itchyny/gojq) |\n`v0.12.19` → `v0.12.20` |\n![age](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/age/go/github.com%2fitchyny%2fgojq/v0.12.20?slim=true)\n|\n![confidence](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/go/github.com%2fitchyny%2fgojq/v0.12.19/v0.12.20?slim=true)\n|\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>itchyny/gojq (github.com/itchyny/gojq)</summary>\n\n###\n[`v0.12.20`](https://redirect.github.com/itchyny/gojq/blob/HEAD/CHANGELOG.md#v01220-2026-11-01)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/itchyny/gojq/compare/v0.12.19...v0.12.20)\n\n- implement `gojq.ToInt` and `gojq.ToFloat64` for converting number\nvalues\n- fix destructuring alternative operator (`?//`) to reset variables of\n  later alternatives, and to propagate `break` and `halt` errors\n- fix update-assignment operator against object with overlapping paths\n- fix `delpaths` function to delete ancestor paths before descendant\npaths\n- fix `getpath` function against string input\n- fix indexing and slicing a number literal written after a unary\noperator\n- fix slice indices of floating point numbers for jq compatibility\n- fix date and time functions against fractional, non-finite, and out of\nrange numbers\n- fix `strptime` function to accept the zero time instant\n- fix `match`, `test`, and `capture` functions to support array\narguments\n- fix `match` function to report an empty match after a non-empty one\n- fix `split/1` function against empty input string\n- fix math functions against large number literals like `1e1000`\n- fix `jn/2` and `yn/2` functions to avoid long recurrence on large\norders\n- fix `abs` function against non-numbers for jq compatibility\n- fix `isnan` function to return false for non-numbers for jq\ncompatibility\n- fix `halt_error` function not to print a newline after non-string\nvalues\n- fix `--argjson` and `--jsonargs` options to reject empty and multiple\nJSON values\n- fix `--stream` option error message against unterminated input\n- fix JSON parse error message after a large value in non-seekable input\nlike stdin\n- fix offset of YAML parse error on multi-byte characters\n- fix panic on continuing iteration after an invalid path error\n- fix data race on input iterator when running code concurrently\n- fix `add` function to handle a nil map and slice as the first value\n- support destructuring alternative operator (`?//`) in `reduce` and\n`foreach` syntax\n- allow optional operator followed by alternative operator without\nspaces (`.a?//1`)\n- improve performance of function calls by avoiding copies of scope\nvalues,\nand path tracking in `path`, `paths`, `|=`, and `del` by reducing\nallocations\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n  - \"on tuesday\"\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Disabled by config. Please merge this manually once you\nare satisfied.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or you tick the\nrebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update\nagain.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check\nthis box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/).\nView the [repository job\nlog](https://developer.mend.io/github/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector).\n\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0NC4yMDIuMSIsInVwZGF0ZWRJblZlciI6IjQ0LjIwMi4xIiwidGFyZ2V0QnJhbmNoIjoibWFpbiIsImxhYmVscyI6WyJkZXBlbmRlbmNpZXMiLCJyZW5vdmF0ZWJvdCJdfQ==-->\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
