          "message": "[chore] Use the pkg/componentstatus component name in the watcher cha… (#16317)\n\n#### Description\n\nThe entry from #16304 still used the old name. #16314 renamed the\ncomponentstatus chloggen component from pkg/component/componentstatus to\npkg/componentstatus, so chlog-validate failed on main.\n\n#### Link to tracking issue\n\nRelated to #16304, #16314\n\n#### Testing\n\n- make chlog-validate passes\n\n#### Documentation\n\nNo.\n\n#### Authorship\n\n- [x] I, a human, wrote this pull request description myself.",
