          "message": "[chore] Fix 16364 (#16376)\n\n#### Description\nFixing #16364 by:\n* Fixing the dir embedded in the error message returned when creating a\ntest directory fails.\n* Updating the godoc on `NewCommand()` to not mention incoming\nparameters/configs/providers/etc, which were inaccurate/confusing\nbecause the func accepts no args.\n\n#### Link to tracking issue\nFixes #16364\n\n#### Testing\nNo tests, this should be a trivial change.\n\n#### Documentation\nUpdated godoc.\n\n#### Authorship\n- [x] I, a human, wrote this pull request description myself.",
