          "id": "f97fccec18c3f2daae9d06e5c076d35e282a237d",
          "message": "[chore] Fix CONTRIBUTING guidance on adding components to otelcorecol (#16375)\n\n#### Description\nUpdated CONTRIBUTING.md to fix incorrect instructions for adding\ncomponents to the collector.\nPreviously, the guide told contributors to manually edit\ncmd/otelcorecol/components.go, even though it is a generated file marked\nDO NOT EDIT.\nThe instructions now tells contributors to update\ncmd/otelcorecol/builder-config.yaml and run make genotelcorecol to\nregenerate the component files.\n\n\n<!-- Issue number if applicable -->\n#### Link to tracking issue\nFixes #16361 \n\n<!--Describe what testing was performed and which tests were added.-->\n#### Testing\nRan make genotelcorecol and confirmed that it regenerated the files\nunder cmd/otelcorecol.\n\n<!--Describe the documentation added.-->\n#### Documentation\nUpdated CONTRIBUTING.md to describe the correct component generation\nworkflow.\n\n<!--Authorship attestation. See AGENTS.md for details. AI agents must\nnot check this box on behalf\nof the user; the human author must check it themselves before the PR is\nready for review.-->\n#### Authorship\n\n- [x] I, a human, wrote this pull request description myself.\n\n<!--Please delete paragraphs that you did not use before submitting.-->",
