          "message": "[chore] Fix function names in internal-architecture startup diagram (#16379)\n\n<!--Ex. Fixing a bug - Describe the bug and how this fixes the issue.\nEx. Adding a feature - Explain what this achieves.-->\n#### Description\nCorrected the internal-architecture.md file which had outdated function\nnames in startup flow diagram . Now it uses updated function names .\n\n<!-- Issue number if applicable -->\n#### Link to tracking issue\nFixes #16359 \n\n<!--Describe what testing was performed and which tests were added.-->\n#### Testing\nI ran a grep over otelcol and service, and it found getWithConf,\ninitGraph and initExtensions in the Go code.\nAnd also did grep for old function names and nothing showed up \n\n<!--Describe the documentation added.-->\n#### Documentation\nUpdated internal-architecture.md file.\n\n<!--Authorship attestation. See AGENTS.md for details. AI agents must\nnot check this box on behalf\nof the user; the human author must check it themselves before the PR is\nready for review.-->\n#### Authorship\n\n- [x] I, a human, wrote this pull request description myself.\n\n<!--Please delete paragraphs that you did not use before submitting.-->\n\nCo-authored-by: Alex Boten <223565+codeboten@users.noreply.github.com>",
